Hello,

Ubisoft and Growtopia take player safety, cheating, and any breach of our c=
odes of conduct very seriously. if your account has been sanctioned, please=
 review our code of conduct and the Growtopian code from the below links to=
 get more information about our rules:

Ubisoft Code of Conduct:
https://ubisoft-mobile.helpshift.com/hc/en/43-ubisoft-mobile-main/faq/849-c=
ode-of-conduct-the-way-we-play/

Growtopian Code:
https://ubisoft-mobile.helpshift.com/hc/en/26-growtopia/section/337-the-gro=
wtopian-code/=20

Please note that any temporary suspension will be automatically removed whe=
n it expires. However, feel free to reply to this email if you believe that=
 the sanction is unwarranted.

However, if  your account is permanently suspended, it will not be released=
 and we will not respond to any further e-mails about it. Also, please reme=
mber that if an account is permanently suspended, owners are not supposed t=
o play the game anymore. If they do, this is known as "ban evasion" and, ac=
cording to our rules and The Growtopian Code, that is eligible for the acco=
unt's permanent suspension.

Also note that in order to avoid delays and confusion, please refrain from =
sending multiple cases to support. We will do our best to get to your repor=
t as soon as we can.

Best regards,
The Growtopia Team


